{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07065","headline":"送李员外使还苏州兼呈前袁州李使君赋得长字袁州即员外之从兄 · 刘长卿","name":"送李员外使还苏州兼呈前袁州李使君赋得长字袁州即员外之从兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别离共成怨，衰老更难忘。\n夜月留同舍，秋风在远乡。\n朱弦徐向烛，白发强临觞。\n归献西陵作，谁知此路长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07065.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07065","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}